{
  "job_B2.2.10_20251003_114500": {
    "chunk_text": "& He aflymde his agene f\u00e6der eft of \u00f0am ylcan fores\u00e6dan iglande \u00fee Creta hatte & wolde hine forfaran & se Iouis wear\u00f0 swa swy\u00f0e gal \u00fe\u00e6t he on his agenre swyster gewifode, seo w\u00e6s genamod Iuno, & heo Heora twa dohtra w\u00e6ron Minerua & Uenus. \u00deas manfullan men \u00fee we ymbe speca\u00f0 w\u00e6ron getealde for \u00f0a m\u00e6rostan godas \u00fea on \u00f0am dagum, & \u00fea Ac se sunu w\u00e6s swa\u00feeah swy\u00f0or on h\u00e6\u00f0enscype gewur\u00f0od \u00feonne se f\u00e6der w\u00e6re, & he is geteald eac And he hatte \u00feor o\u00f0rum naman betwux sumum \u00feeodum; \u00f0one Denisca leoda lufia\u00f0 swy\u00f0ost & on heora His sunu hatte Mars, se macode \u00e6fre gewinn & wrohte, & saca & wraca he styrede gelome. \u00d0ysne yrming \u00e6fter his for\u00f0si\u00f0e wur\u00f0odon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan eac for healicne god, & swa oft swa hy & hy gelyfdon \u00fe\u00e6t he miclum mihte heom fultumian on gefeohte for\u00f0an \u00fee he gefeoht & gewinn lufude Sum man eac w\u00e6s gehaten Mercurius on life, se w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e facenfull & \u00f0eah full snotorwyrde swicol \u00d0one macedon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan be heora get\u00e6le eac heom to m\u00e6ran gode, & \u00e6t wega gel\u00e6tum him lac \u00d0es gedwolgod w\u00e6s arwur\u00f0e eac betwux eallum h\u00e6\u00f0enum on \u00feam dagum, & he is O\u00f0on gehaten Nu secga\u00f0 sume \u00fea Denisce men on heora gedwylde \u00fe\u00e6t se Iouis w\u00e6re \u00fee",
